 "script": "Thanksgiving road trip! Better tell the whole world I'm gone.\n\nSign on the door. Selfie for the internet. Nailed it!\n\nUh oh. Who ordered all these packages?\n\nThe average burglary costs the victim about two thousand six hundred sixty-one dollars.\n\nSo before you hit the road, do this.\n\nOne. Put your lights on timers, and hold your mail and deliveries.\n\nTwo. Post the trip photos after you get home.\n\nThree. Lock every door and window, and ask a neighbor to check in.\n\nIf Homie can handle it, so can you.",
